0:{"buildId":"-cWzmSOyU1muirH5dfsk2","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Fix TikTok Landing Page Disconnects to Transform Views Into Sales\",\"description\":\"TikTok ads driving views but zero sales? The creative isn't the problem - your landing page may be blocking the conversion. Here's the structural disconnect to fix.\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#founder\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-21\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-21\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/learning-centre/tiktok-ads-not-converting\"},\"image\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/opengraph-image\"}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/learning-centre","className":"text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-fg transition-colors","children":"← Learning Centre"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8 md:p-10","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent","children":"TikTok Ads Leaks · tiktok ad to landing page mismatch"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg md:text-5xl","children":"Fix TikTok Landing Page Disconnects to Transform Views Into Sales"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Your TikTok ad stopped the scroll. The hook worked. The click happened. Then the page loaded - and the sale didn't. That gap between ad click and conversion isn't a targeting problem or a creative problem. It's a landing page problem, and it has a specific anatomy you can diagnose and fix."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre-tiktok-ads-not-converting&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"The Emotional State Mismatch"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"TikTok creative is engineered to spike emotional engagement - fast cuts, pattern-interrupts, social proof in the form of UGC and reactions, raw authenticity. When that ad works, the user who clicks is in a heightened state: curious, excited, maybe impulsive. They are primed to buy."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Then they land on a page that looks like it was designed in 2019 by a corporate marketing team. Polished stock photography. A tagline that sounds like an investor pitch. A hero section that talks about the company instead of the customer's problem. That thermal shock kills the sale before the user reads a single line of copy."}],"$L3"]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8"]}]]}],null,"$L9"]}],"isPartial":"$@a","staleTime":"$b","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Lc","isPartial":"$@d","staleTime":"$b","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Le","isPartial":"$@f","staleTime":"$b","varyParams":"$10"},{"rsc":"$L11","isPartial":"$@12","staleTime":"$b","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@13","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@14"}
